  "summary": {
    "value": "ColQwen2 is a model based on a novel model architecture and training strategy based on Vision Language Models (VLMs) to efficiently index documents from their visual features. It is a Qwen2-VL-2B extension that generates ColBERT- style multi-vector representations of text and images.",
